{"title":"AI is Not Slowing Down, Except for Stop Lights","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/909772943/0/marginalrevolution~AI-is-Not-Slowing-Down-Except-for-Stop-Lights.html","date":1734783296000,"content":"<p>After 25.3 million fully autonomous miles a<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://waymo.com/research/do-autonomous-vehicles-outperform-latest-generation-human-driven-vehicles-25-million-miles/\"> new study from Waymo and Swiss Re</a> concludes:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>[T]he Waymo ADS significantly outperformed both the overall driving population (88% reduction in property damage claims, 92% in bodily injury claims), and outperformed the more stringent latest-generation HDV benchmark (86% reduction in property damage claims and 90% in bodily injury claims). This substantial safety improvement over our previous 3.8-million-mile study not only validates ADS safety at scale but also provides a new approach for ongoing ADS evaluation.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>As you may also have heard, o3 is solving 25% of Frontier Math challenges–these are not in the training set and are challenging for Fields medal winners. Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/deedydas/status/1870286948235128939\">some examples</a> of the types of questions:</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5.png\" width=\"1716\" height=\"1084\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5.png 1716w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5-300x190.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5-1024x647.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5-768x485.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GfSYETMasAEKqC5-1536x970.png 1536w\" />Thus, we are rapidly approaching super human driving and super human mathematics.</p>\r\n<p>Stop looking to the sky for aliens, they are already here.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/ai-is-not-slowing-down-except-for-stop-lights.html\">AI is Not Slowing Down, Except for Stop Lights</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/909772943/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/909772943/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/909772943/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2024%2f12%2fGfSYETMasAEKqC5.png\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/909772943/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/909772943/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/909772943/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/ai-is-not-slowing-down-except-for-stop-lights.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/ai-is-not-slowing-down-except-for-stop-lights.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/stephan-miran-nominated-to-head-the-cea.